/P 147 0 R
/E (In Greece, the Curriculum was piloted at Dimotiko Scholeio Plateos with 52 students aged 9 to 11 and six teachers. The sessions included Act Green, Think Fair, focusing on climate action through Tale-Bot programming; Dilemmas with Values, where students created interactive ethical stories using Scratch; and Treasure Hunters, combining LEGO SPIKE robotics with storytelling and theatrical performance. The cohort was highly diverse, including students of Roma origin and learners with Special Educational Needs such as ASD, ADHD, and learning disabilities.  )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
