/P 149 0 R
/E (On 5 November 2025, the Multiplier Event in Imathia, Greece \(Primary School of Platy\) brought together 40 participants, including school counsellors, primary school directors, in-service teachers, university students, parents, and community members. The event presented the Robots Meet Arts Teacher Training material and Curriculum, followed by hands-on workshops using BeeBot, LEGO Spike Essential, and Vinci Robot. The interactive format fostered strong engagement, networking, and high motivation among educators to integrate robotics and computational thinking into Arts and Humanities subjects.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
