/E (The Multiplier Event in Lleida, Spain, held on 4 December 2025, gathered 33 participants, including students, teachers, the dean, and education leads. Hosted in innovative learning spaces such as a STEAM classroom and science laboratory, the event focused on disseminating the project results, particularly the Teacher Training material and Curriculum. Through guided visits and practical workshops, participants explored inclusive methodologies and hands-on robotics activities integrating computational thinking into diverse subject areas.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [14]
